        "\n",
        "$$\n",
        "H(X)\\approx 0.61086\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "**Marginal Entropy of $Y$:**\n",
        "$$\n",
        "H(Y)=-(0.50\\ln 0.50+0.20\\ln 0.20+0.10\\ln 0.10+0.20\\ln 0.20).\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\n",
        "H(Y)\\approx 1.22061\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\n",
        "**Joint Entropy $H(X, Y)$:**\n",
        "$$\n",
        "H(X,Y)= -\\sum_{x,y} P(x,y)\\ln P(x,y),\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\n",
        "H(X,Y)=-(0.50\\ln 0.50+0.20\\ln 0.20+0.10\\ln 0.10+0.20\\ln 0.20)\n",
